# Sound goes out over HDMI to the monitor, which passes it to the speakers.
# Card 0 device 3 is the one that works -- the monitor reports eld_valid 0,
# meaning it claims to have no audio, but it plays anyway. Without this,
# anything using ALSA directly picks card 0 device 0 and is silent.
defaults.pcm.card 0
defaults.pcm.device 3
defaults.ctl.card 0
